{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07318","headline":"夏口送长宁杨明府归荆南因寄幕府诸公 · 刘长卿","name":"夏口送长宁杨明府归荆南因寄幕府诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"关西杨太尉，千载德犹闻。\n白日俱终老，清风独至君。\n身承远祖遗，才出衆人羣。\n举世贪荆玉，全家恋楚云。\n向烟帆杳杳，临水叶纷纷。\n草覆昭丘绿，江从夏口分。\n高名光盛府，异姓宠殊勳。\n百越今无事，南征欲罢军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07318.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07318","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}